OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for 10 years for     
OL,4,Aexplosives offences                    
OL,6,FA woman who made explosive substances  
OL,7,Fhas been jailed for 10 years for       
OL,8,Fcausing criminal damage to McDonald's  
OL,9,Fand Starbucks stores and a building    
OL,10,Fthat houses the BBC.                   
OL,12,FMartha Goddard, 51, carried out the    
OL,13,Fattacks in Norwich last year and was   
OL,14,Fcaptured on CCTV setting light to      
OL,15,Fimprovised incendiary devices.         
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
